; --- BACKDROPS ---------------------------------------------------------
; F6050 (purple radial burst) behind Mika's pose, F6010 (orange sweep) behind
; her and Zangief. Both are 28 frame loops out of data/fightfx.air and are
; left to RUN - an explod cued through animelem freezes on its last frame, so
; these are ordinary page-gated elements rather than a cued layer.
; sprpriority 3 is the slot E-Ryu and Sodom-X already use for an F60xx ending
; backdrop: above the stage, below the portrait layer at 5.
; removetime 520 is page 3's tick, so the swap lands on the page turn.
